1
00:00:04,553 --> 00:00:06,383
[SLOW COUNTRY MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:09,725 --> 00:00:14,605
Ugh. I cannot believe Christy let Howard
into my apartment.

3
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,270
And I cannot believe people pay
for horoscopes...

4
00:00:17,441 --> 00:00:21,781
...but on a more serious note,
it's 8:13 and we're still not playing "Halo."

5
00:00:21,945 --> 00:00:24,825
Okay, fine. We'll just play one-on-one
until he gets back.

6
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,740
One-on-one? We don't play one-on-one.

7
00:00:26,909 --> 00:00:30,699
We play teams, not one-on-one.
One-on-one.

8
00:00:31,163 --> 00:00:35,333
(Leonard:)Well, the only way we can play teams
at this point is if we cut Raj in half.

9
00:00:35,626 --> 00:00:39,586
(Raj:)Sure, cut the foreigner in half.
There's a billion more where he came from.

10
00:00:39,963 --> 00:00:42,003
(Penny:)Hey, if you guys need a fourth, I'll play.

11
00:00:42,174 --> 00:00:44,714
(Sheldon:)- Great idea.
- Uh, no.

12
00:00:45,761 --> 00:00:49,801
(Sheldon:)The wheel was a great idea.
Relativity was a great idea.

13
00:00:49,973 --> 00:00:52,893
(Sheldon:)This is a notion,
and a rather sucky one at that.

14
00:00:53,769 --> 00:00:55,809
- Why?
- Why? Oh...

15
00:00:55,979 --> 00:00:59,399
(Sheldon:)- Penny, Penny, Penny.
- What, what, what?

16
00:00:59,566 --> 00:01:02,736
(Sheldon:)This is a complex battle simulation
with a steep learning curve.

